Z||000000||Scott2M4||02-07-2000||11:18 AM||||OK, folks.  The 2/5 trip was so much fun for me, (call me crazy but) I'm trying to get another one started.  This time, I'm trying to hook up the fellow Fieroholics in the Columbus area.<P>I've been in contact with ChadMan.  He mentioned having lunch at a small place outside of Columbus called the Hickory House and a small cruise down route 315 along the river.<P>So, who else is in?  <B>hefty</B>, <B>Eric</B>?  How about you guys?  <B>wwh0001</B>, we probably drove by your house on 2/5.  Can you make it on 2/26?  Who else?||||reg||1
