Z||000008||ChadMan||02-07-2000||05:46 PM||||I just called Hickory House and they are open from 11 AM - 11 PM on Saturdays.  They are located at 240 N. Liberty St in Powell.  If memory serves, you get there by taking 315 north to Powell Rd, turn left, then take Powell west to Liberty, turn right, and there you are.<P>A buddy and I stopped there for burgers during a motorcycle ride once.  Pretty nice place!  Kind of rustic and with good food, but not snooty.||||reg||6
Z||000009||fiero56||02-07-2000||06:18 PM||||In case I go, just remember some of us might be minors <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">, just so one of us doesn't have to wait in the parking lot while the rest go in. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
