Z||000011||Eric||02-07-2000||06:34 PM||||Is Powell and Liberty the old intersection in the middle of town that used to be a four way stop?  I hated that intersection before they put the light in.  Whenever I worked over in the Dublin area, I had to go through Powell in the evening rush.  If it's not the traffic that gets you, it's the trains.  In any case, I never even knew that resturant existed over there.  Guess there's always something to learn from a fellow fieroguy.<P>Where else is this cruise going to go?  I always like driving out east towards Knox and Licking county.  The scenery is tons better than back home and so are the roads.  I go to school at Newark and sometimes after class if the weather's good, I drive out into the hills and try to get myself lost.  Maybe this would be a good idea for a cruise sometime (no set route, just see where you end up)  Sounds fun to me!<P>Are your cars going to be spit shined?  I'd hate to make a good group look bad, but I've got bodywork in progress plus I live on a dirt road.  Kind of makes things hard to keep clean, but I'll try the best I can.||||reg||1
