Z||000014||fiero56||02-07-2000||08:07 PM||||I won't be legal yet. Not for a while yet. My Fiero will be in its normal condition inside. If its above freezing before I leave maybe I'll give it a wash. But this is a 100 mile drive for me, I'm undecided right now as to weather I'll go.<P>When its warm outside, I just hop in the Fiero and drive with no destination in mind, try to get myself lost. I ended up somewhere in clearcreek twp today. I am always able to find my way back home so far, but one of these days it'll happen.||||reg||1
Z||000015||Formula||02-07-2000||08:19 PM||||I could probably make it if the weather is good.  You couldn't have it at 7:00 in the morning though because I would have to wake up at 4.  And my gf wouldn't like that...<P>or I could just bring a friend. hmmmmmmm....<P>and I'm not legal age either. 18||||reg||1
