Z||000036||william_thorniii||02-15-2000||08:11 PM||||Phil,<P>Believe me... the only dancing this guy does is in a Fiero... but the woman is usually happy enough if I sit at a table on the edge of the dance floor... I can handle that now and again if it makes her happy.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
