Z||000041||william_thorniii||02-17-2000||05:37 PM||||Scott,<P>I will be going one way or another!  Hey why did you change your name from 2m4?  I was wondering who this 87EC clown was, then I checked the profile and I see it was you Mr. JUNIOR Member!<P>56,<P>It looks like I might have an empty seat that you could fill.  Remember that there isn't much leg room over there though.  Do you think that we should tighten that other bolt before we get on the hwy to Columbus?  Or maybe take that nail out of my rear drivers side tire?  Naaaahhh!  It wouldn't be nearly as exciting.  Just joking, I will try to get everything all fixed up. <P>William T. Thorn, III<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000042||87ECO5||02-18-2000||06:44 AM||||Bummer.  The secret's out already!  Guess I shouldn't have used that email address, huh?<P>Why?  A change of pace, I guess.  Or, since everyone's concerned with how high their post numbers are, I thought I'd go the other way and keep the lowest!  At the rate I post, that means a new UserName about every three months!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>BTW, glad to hear you're determined to go.  Hope we can convince Drew.  I can't go on this trip without my two local buds!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000043||ChadMan||02-20-2000||10:25 AM||||It's a nice morning for cruising (in Ohio, that means it's not snowing), so I drove up to Hickory House and back just to make sure the directions I gave Scott are accurate.<P>They are, EXCEPT that there's no sign saying "Powell Road" at the intersection of 315 North and Powell!  Instead, it says "Jct. St. Rt. 750."<P>So we'll amend one line of the directions as follows:<P>- At the 270/315 interchange, take 315 North for about 3 miles to Rt.750 (Powell Road).<P>You guys probably would have found it anyway.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||4
